      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "POMDP tuple -> code\nS  hidden state (never read)\nb  factored JSON belief\nA  Action (recon/exploit/...)\nO  Observation.raw\nZ  LLM likelihoods (update_belief)\nT  action routing (_target_factor)\nR  score_action + priors\npi choose_action\ngamma  GAMMA discount",
